,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-arabic text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-300 leading-loose","children":"اللَّهُمَّ ارْحَمْنِي بِالْقُرْآنِ، وَاجْعَلْهُ لِي إِمَامًا وَنُورًا وَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةً، اللَّهُمَّ ذَكِّرْنِي مِنْهُ مَا نَسِيتُ، وَعَلِّمْنِي مِنْهُ مَا جَهِلْتُ، وَارْزُقْنِي تِلَاوَتَهُ آنَاءَ اللَّيْلِ وَأَطْرَافَ النَّهَارِ، وَاجْعَلْهُ لِي حُجَّةً يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 block","children":"English Transliteration"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed italic","children":"“Allahumma irhamni bil-Qur’an, waj’alhu li imaman wa nuran wa hudan wa rahmah. Allahumma dhakkirni minhu ma nassitu, wa ‘allimni minhu ma jahiltu, warzuqni tilawatahu ana’a al-layli wa atraf an-nahar, waj’alhu li hujjatan ya Rabbal ‘Alameen.”"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 block","children":"English Translation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed","children":"“O Allah, have mercy upon me by the Quran, and make it for me a guide, a light, guidance, and mercy. O Allah, remind me of what I have forgotten from it, teach me what I am ignorant of from it, grant me its recitation during the hours of the night and at the ends of the day, and make it an argument in my favor, O Lord of the worlds.”"}]]}]]}]]}]
